<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Intelligent Reminders — PulseReach</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=11"></head><body class="app"><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark">♥</span> PulseReach</a><div class="org"><div class="avatar"><%= organizer.name.slice(0,2).toUpperCase() %></div><div><b><%= organizer.name %></b><small><%= organizer.organization %></small></div></div><nav class="side-nav"><a href="/dashboard">⌂ Overview</a><a href="/participants">♙ Participants</a><a class="active" href="/reminders">✦ Reminders</a><a href="/communications">✉ Communications</a><% if (['OWNER','MANAGER'].includes(organizer.role)) { %><a href="/volunteers">♙ Volunteers</a><a href="/audit">◌ Audit trail</a><% } %></nav><div class="side-bottom"><form method="post" action="/logout"><button class="side-logout">↪ Sign out</button></form></div></aside><main class="main"><header class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">INTELLIGENT MOBILISATION</div><h1>Personalised reminders</h1><p>Consent-aware reminders adapt to language, confirmation, response behaviour and time remaining.</p></div></header><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Run reminder generation</h2><p>Gemini decides whether each eligible notification should be generated. Generated notifications are logged and appear in the donor dashboard.</p></div></div><div class="drive-list"><% drives.forEach(d=>{ %><div class="communication-drive"><div><b><%= d.name %></b><small><%= d.venue %> · <%= new Date(d.date).toLocaleString('en-IN') %></small></div><form method="post" action="/reminders/run/<%= d._id %>"><button class="btn btn-primary">Generate intelligent reminders</button></form></div><% }) %><% if (!drives.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No drives available.</b><p>Create a drive first.</p></div><% } %></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Reminder opportunity</h2><p>Participants shown here have current-drive communication consent and still need mobilisation follow-up.</p></div><span class="score-pill"><%= participants.length %> eligible</span></div><div class="message-list"><% if (!participants.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No reminder opportunity right now.</b><p>Confirmed or consent-withdrawn participants are automatically excluded.</p></div><% } %><% participants.slice(0,20).forEach(p=>{ %><article class="message-card"><div class="message-meta"><span class="status"><%= p.confirmationStatus %></span><span><%= p.preferredLanguage %></span><span><%= p.predictedAttendance %>% predicted</span><span><%= p.reminderEngagement || 0 %> engagement</span></div><p><b><%= p.name %></b> · <%= p.driveId?.name || 'Drive' %></p><small>Registration <%= p.registrationCode %></small></article><% }) %></div></section></main><script src="/js/pulsereach-assistant.js?v=1"></script></body></html>
